'''Super Smash Families''' (大乱闘極悪ファミリーズ ''Dai Rantō Gokuaku Famirīzu'', '''Big Brawl Malevolent Families''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]] and appears on the '''16th''' day of every month. It is unlocked after clearing all 9 [[:Category:Malevolent Stages|Malevolent Stages]], and serves as the Malevolent equivalent of [[Clan of the Maniacs]]. The 1st stage drops 1 [[Cat Capsule|Rare Ticket]] when cleared for the first time, while the 2nd stage drops 2 Rare Tickets on first clear.

